{"4624320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Man-U-Facture", "steam_appid": 4624320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest, Refine, Profit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start off small with a patch of wood. Refine it into planks, turn it into a chair. Once you've gotten the hang of that, move on to more exotic materials like fluff from genetically modified dust bunnies and crystal made from meteorite! Combine material types when you make furniture to maximize your profit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness the Power of the AWN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Automated Logistic Assembly Work Network is here to provide you with ALANs, recent PHD grads looking for work. More efficient than your run-off-the-mill conveyor belt and infinitely more merchandisable, these eager employees run your factory with the utmost efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees to manage and transport resources to automate the process of creating furniture. See as your factory becomes a well oiled-machine and watch from the factory catwalk as ALANs scurry to assemble furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Monopoly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete milestones to unlock all 16 furniture and materials  and grow your business from a simple startup to a furniture monopoly! </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest, Refine, Profit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start off small with a patch of wood. Refine it into planks, turn it into a chair. Once you've gotten the hang of that, move on to more exotic materials like fluff from genetically modified dust bunnies and crystal made from meteorite! Combine material types when you make furniture to maximize your profit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness the Power of the AWN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Automated Logistic Assembly Work Network is here to provide you with ALANs, recent PHD grads looking for work. More efficient than your run-off-the-mill conveyor belt and infinitely more merchandisable, these eager employees run your factory with the utmost efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees to manage and transport resources to automate the process of creating furniture. See as your factory becomes a well oiled-machine and watch from the factory catwalk as ALANs scurry to assemble furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Monopoly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete milestones to unlock all 16 furniture and materials  and grow your business from a simple startup to a furniture monopoly! </p>", "short_description": "Man-U-Facture is a short, casual factory game about making furniture out of random materials. Using the powers of unpaid interns, make chairs out of wacky items from rusty metal to hyper-dense stars!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4624320/20c13b6767e979721f7516bd3b6fdfe3d9840b41/header.jpg?t=1777661827", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4624320/3e7604fa2b96436ed5ff436a18281e682165e5a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777661827", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4624320/3e7604fa2b96436ed5ff436a18281e682165e5a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777661827", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 1070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 739 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["ZachIDK"], "publishers": ["Iduknow Entertainment"], "price_overview": {"c